{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to the Ridiculous Gungame Demo!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight your friends in this fast-paced instagib shooter featuring absolutely ridiculous guns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666340/extras/jelly.gif?t=1748525953\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Maps!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will have access to 4 maps in the Demo!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nebula's Edge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Four Seasons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pirates Paradise</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Winston's Churchhill</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666340/extras/4Maps.png?t=1748525953\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Guns!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And 12 ridiculous guns to kill your friends with! What's that? You're wondering why there is a Trombone, or a flower? Guess you'll just have to play the game to find out what they do!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666340/extras/12Weapons.png?t=1748525953\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3666340?t=1748525953","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666340/1a71c6e65e5dcfd7ad4aaf0d869aafa024fac5eb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748525953","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666340/b0b2cfd91bc7b1f295b34756a9570cb5dc77b7d3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748525953","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666340/b0b2cfd91bc7b1f295b34756a9570cb5dc77b7d3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748525953","categories":[{"description":"Multi